+- Claim type `bounded_theorem` (T1–T3); trace class `frontier_discovery` (the measurement); status `bounded-support`; audit required.
+
+## Not claimed
+`c(β) → 1` as `β → ∞` as a theorem; the longest mode's finite-size behaviour; whether the gravity lane should use this channel; any reading, menu, rule or coupling as physical.
